12	/*
13	 * LOONG-HAT SPI Flash sample for Loongson 2K0300 / OpenHarmony 6.1 mini.
14	 *
15	 * This sample drives the LOONG-HAT SPI Flash with the 2K0300 hardware SPI2
16	 * controller (no GPIO bit-bang).  The LOONG-HAT 40PIN header labels the
17	 * interface "SPI0", but on the 2K0300 these pins belong to the SPI2
18	 * controller (see chip manual 1.3 功能引脚复用关系表).
19	 *
20	 * SCK  : GPIO64 / J12 Pin23  -> spi2_clk  (pinmux MAIN_FUNC)
21	 * MISO : GPIO65 / J12 Pin21  -> spi2_miso (pinmux MAIN_FUNC)
22	 * MOSI : GPIO66 / J12 Pin19  -> spi2_mosi (pinmux MAIN_FUNC)
23	 * CSN  : GPIO85 / J12 Pin26  -> GPIO software CS (CSN2, measured)
24	 *
25	 * SPI2-IO controller base: 0x1610c000 (2K0300 user manual ch.10),
26	 * defined as LS_SPI2_BASE in device/soc/loongson/ls2k300/liteos_m/inc/ls2k300.h.
27	 *
28	 * WARNING:
29	 * This sample erases the last 4KB sector of the SPI Flash detected by JEDEC ID,
30	 * then writes and reads back a small test pattern.
31	 */
32	
